ntler processing method preserves more nutrients and natural flavors by baking black sesame at lower temperatures">This gentler processing method preserves more nutrients and natural flavors by baking black sesame at lower temperatures</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="While it usually takes longer">While it usually takes longer</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="it ensures better texture and quality">it ensures better texture and quality</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Extrusion and Expansion">Extrusion and Expansion</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="A modern processing technique that uses mechanical extrusion and high temperature and pressure to quickly expand black sesame">A modern processing technique that uses mechanical extrusion and high temperature and pressure to quickly expand black sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-source="" data-orig="creating a crunchy product">creating a crunchy product</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_82" data-source="" data-orig="While this enhances convenience and taste">While this enhances convenience and taste</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_83" data-source="" data-orig="it may affect its nutritional content">it may affect its nutritional content</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_84" data-source="" data-orig="Low-temperature Crushing">Low-temperature Crushing</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_85" data-source="" data-orig="This method targets extracting oil from black sesame by crushing and pressing it under low-temperature conditions">This method targets extracting oil from black sesame by crushing and pressing it under low-temperature conditions</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_86" data-source="" data-orig="preserving the nutritional components and natural flavors of the oil while preventing high temperatures from degrading its quality">preserving the nutritional components and natural flavors of the oil while preventing high temperatures from degrading its quality</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_are_the_uses_of_black_sesame"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_87" data-source="" data-orig="What are the uses of black sesame">What are the uses of black sesame</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_88" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame has many uses">Black sesame has many uses</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_89" data-source="" data-orig="including the production of black sesame paste">including the production of black sesame paste</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_90" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame candy">black sesame candy</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_91" data-source="" data-orig="and black sesame oil">and black sesame oil</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_92" data-source="" data-orig="It can also serve as a baking ingredient for making pastries and bread">It can also serve as a baking ingredient for making pastries and bread</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_93" data-source="" data-orig="In traditional Chinese medicine">In traditional Chinese medicine</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="it is noted for its benefits in nourishing the liver and kidneys and moisturizing dryness">it is noted for its benefits in nourishing the liver and kidneys and moisturizing dryness</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="Notably">Notably</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame oil is produced through a traditional method that extracts oil from black sesame">black sesame oil is produced through a traditional method that extracts oil from black sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="resulting in a product with a unique aroma and nutritional value">resulting in a product with a unique aroma and nutritional value</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame oil is dark in color">Black sesame oil is dark in color</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="aromatic">aromatic</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="and has a distinct sesame flavor">and has a distinct sesame flavor</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="It is rich in unsaturated fatty acids">It is rich in unsaturated fatty acids</span>, ビタミンe, そしてミネラル, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="offering high nutritional value">offering high nutritional value</span>.</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="Unsaturated Fatty Acids">Unsaturated Fatty Acids</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="Help lower cholesterol and triglyceride levels in the blood">Help lower cholesterol and triglyceride levels in the blood</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="maintaining lipid balance">maintaining lipid balance</span>.</li><li><strong>ビタミンE</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="Exhibits excellent antioxidant properties">Exhibits excellent antioxidant properties</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="clearing free radicals from the body and delaying aging">clearing free radicals from the body and delaying aging</span>.</li><li><strong>ミネラル</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="Such as calcium">Such as calcium</span>, マグネシウム, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="and iron">and iron</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="play positive roles in bone health and blood pressure regulation">play positive roles in bone health and blood pressure regulation</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Is_Black_Sesame_Nutritionally_Valuable_Compared_to_White_Sesame"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="Is Black Sesame Nutritionally Valuable Compared to White Sesame">Is Black Sesame Nutritionally Valuable Compared to White Sesame</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="Black sesame is highly nutritious">Black sesame is highly nutritious</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="containing significant amounts of fat">containing significant amounts of fat</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="protein">protein</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="carbohydrates">carbohydrates</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="vitamins A and E">vitamins A and E</span>, レシチン, カルシウム, 鉄, などなど. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="It offers benefits such as lowering blood pressure">It offers benefits such as lowering blood pressure</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="promoting hair health">promoting hair health</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="enhancing skin appearance">enhancing skin appearance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="and improving fertility">and improving fertility</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="Compared to white sesame">Compared to white sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame excels in certain aspects">black sesame excels in certain aspects</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="it has">it has</span> 1.43 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="times more insoluble dietary fiber">times more insoluble dietary fiber</span>, 1.26 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="times more calcium">times more calcium</span>, そして 1.33 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="times more vitamin E">times more vitamin E</span>. さらに, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame is rich in anthocyanins">black sesame is rich in anthocyanins</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="which possess strong antioxidant properties">which possess strong antioxidant properties</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="helping to eliminate free radicals and protect cardiovascular health">helping to eliminate free radicals and protect cardiovascular health</span>.</p><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="Given its high nutritional value">Given its high nutritional value</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame can be easily incorporated into daily life">black sesame can be easily incorporated into daily life</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="Here are some ways to utilize it">Here are some ways to utilize it</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="Direct Consumption">Direct Consumption</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_134" data-source="" data-orig="Enjoy black sesame as a snack for quick and convenient nutrition">Enjoy black sesame as a snack for quick and convenient nutrition</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_135" data-source="" data-orig="Cooking Ingredient">Cooking Ingredient</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_136" data-source="" data-orig="Add black sesame to dishes like porridge">Add black sesame to dishes like porridge</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_137" data-source="" data-orig="stir-fries">stir-fries</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_138" data-source="" data-orig="or soups to enhance flavor and nutrition">or soups to enhance flavor and nutrition</span>.</li><li><strong>黒ごま油</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_139" data-source="" data-orig="Extract oil through pressing or infusion for cooking">Extract oil through pressing or infusion for cooking</span>, サラダドレッシング, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_140" data-source="" data-orig="or sauces">or sauces</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_141" data-source="" data-orig="Combining with Other Ingredients">Combining with Other Ingredients</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_142" data-source="" data-orig="Pair black sesame with nutritious foods like dates">Pair black sesame with nutritious foods like dates</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_143" data-source="" data-orig="walnuts">walnuts</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_144" data-source="" data-orig="or oats for enhanced nutritional benefits">or oats for enhanced nutritional benefits</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_145" data-source="" data-orig="Making Black Sesame Powder">Making Black Sesame Powder</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_146" data-source="" data-orig="Grind black sesame into powder to add to milk">Grind black sesame into powder to add to milk</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_147" data-source="" data-orig="soy milk">soy milk</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_148" data-source="" data-orig="or yogurt">or yogurt</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_149" data-source="" data-orig="or use in baking for a richer taste">or use in baking for a richer taste</span>.</li></ul><p><img src="/images/图片21-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone wp-image-447" alt="what is black sesame" width="568" height="568" title="黒のゴマとは何ですか? 10 知っておくと良い事実 5" /></p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="How_to_Choose_High-Quality_Black_Sesame"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_150" data-source="" data-orig="How to Choose High-Quality Black Sesame">How to Choose High-Quality Black Sesame</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_151" data-source="" data-orig="When selecting quality black sesame">When selecting quality black sesame</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_152" data-source="" data-orig="consider the following four aspects">consider the following four aspects</span>:</p><ol><li><strong>起源</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_153" data-source="" data-orig="Quality black sesame is primarily produced in provinces like Shaanxi">Quality black sesame is primarily produced in provinces like Shaanxi</span>, 甘粛省, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_154" data-source="" data-orig="and Henan in China">and Henan in China</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_155" data-source="" data-orig="as well as in regions such as India">as well as in regions such as India</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_156" data-source="" data-orig="Ethiopia">Ethiopia</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_157" data-source="" data-orig="Hawaii">Hawaii</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_158" data-source="" data-orig="Australia">Australia</span>, 日本, カナダ, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_159" data-source="" data-orig="Brazil">Brazil</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_160" data-source="" data-orig="Thailand">Thailand</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_161" data-source="" data-orig="Vietnam">Vietnam</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_162" data-source="" data-orig="Korea">Korea</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_163" data-source="" data-orig="and Madagascar">and Madagascar</span>.</li><li><strong>外観</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_164" data-source="" data-orig="Look for uniform color">Look for uniform color</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_165" data-source="" data-orig="dark gray to black">dark gray to black</span>), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_166" data-source="" data-orig="plump and intact seeds without broken or insect-damaged grains">plump and intact seeds without broken or insect-damaged grains</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_167" data-source="" data-orig="The inside should be white when cut">The inside should be white when cut</span>.</li><li><strong>匂い</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_168" data-source="" data-orig="Fresh black sesame has a distinct aroma">Fresh black sesame has a distinct aroma</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_169" data-source="" data-orig="If it smells off or lacks fragrance">If it smells off or lacks fragrance</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_170" data-source="" data-orig="it may be stale or mixed with impurities">it may be stale or mixed with impurities</span>.</li><li><strong>味</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_171" data-source="" data-orig="Quality black sesame should have a mild sweetness and fragrance">Quality black sesame should have a mild sweetness and fragrance</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_172" data-source="" data-orig="If it tastes bitter or flavorless">If it tastes bitter or flavorless</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_173" data-source="" data-orig="it may be of low quality or dyed">it may be of low quality or dyed</span>.</li></ol><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_174" data-source="" data-orig="You can also check if the sesame leaves a mark when rubbed in your palm or if it discolors in water—true black sesame will not turn the water black but rather a tea color">You can also check if the sesame leaves a mark when rubbed in your palm or if it discolors in water—true black sesame will not turn the water black but rather a tea color</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Should_You_Choose_Shelled_or_Unshelled_Black_Sesame"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_175" data-source="" data-orig="Should You Choose Shelled or Unshelled Black Sesame">Should You Choose Shelled or Unshelled Black Sesame</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_176" data-source="" data-orig="Most black sesame found in stores is unshelled">Most black sesame found in stores is unshelled</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_177" data-source="" data-orig="which retains more nutrients like lignans and has a crunchier texture with a richer flavor">which retains more nutrients like lignans and has a crunchier texture with a richer flavor</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_178" data-source="" data-orig="Shelled black sesame has higher sugar content and lower fiber">Shelled black sesame has higher sugar content and lower fiber</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_179" data-source="" data-orig="making it commonly used for cooking or as a snack">making it commonly used for cooking or as a snack</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_180" data-source="" data-orig="The choice depends on personal preference for nutrition versus taste">The choice depends on personal preference for nutrition versus taste</span>.</p><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Can_Black_Sesame_Be_Used_for_Oil_Extraction"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_181" data-source="" data-orig="Can Black Sesame Be Used for Oil Extraction">Can Black Sesame Be Used for Oil Extraction</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p>はい, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_182" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame can be used for oil extraction due to its high oil content and unique aroma">black sesame can be used for oil extraction due to its high oil content and unique aroma</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_183" data-source="" data-orig="Benefits of black sesame oil include">Benefits of black sesame oil include</span>:</p><ul><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_184" data-source="" data-orig="Blood Pressure Reduction">Blood Pressure Reduction</span></strong>: マグネシウムが豊富です, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_185" data-source="" data-orig="it helps lower blood pressure">it helps lower blood pressure</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_186" data-source="" data-orig="Digestive Aid">Digestive Aid</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_187" data-source="" data-orig="Supports digestion and absorption">Supports digestion and absorption</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_188" data-source="" data-orig="Constipation Relief">Constipation Relief</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_189" data-source="" data-orig="Enhances bowel movements">Enhances bowel movements</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_190" data-source="" data-orig="Skin Health">Skin Health</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_191" data-source="" data-orig="Contains vitamin E">Contains vitamin E</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_192" data-source="" data-orig="offering antioxidant benefits">offering antioxidant benefits</span>.</li><li><strong>ヘアケア</strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_193" data-source="" data-orig="Nourishes hair and promotes melanin production">Nourishes hair and promotes melanin production</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_194" data-source="" data-orig="Nutritional Support">Nutritional Support</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_195" data-source="" data-orig="Rich in iron and vitamin E">Rich in iron and vitamin E</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_196" data-source="" data-orig="it helps prevent anemia">it helps prevent anemia</span>.</li><li><strong><span class ="tr_" id="tr_197" data-source="" data-orig="Cognitive Benefits">Cognitive Benefits</span></strong>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_198" data-source="" data-orig="High in unsaturated fatty acids">High in unsaturated fatty acids</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_199" data-source="" data-orig="it supports brain health">it supports brain health</span>.</li></ul><h2><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Which_Is_Better_for_Oil_Extraction_Black_or_White_Sesame"></span><span class ="tr_" id="tr_200" data-source="" data-orig="Which Is Better for Oil Extraction">Which Is Better for Oil Extraction</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_201" data-source="" data-orig="Black or White Sesame">Black or White Sesame</span>?<span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p><span class ="tr_" id="tr_202" data-source="" data-orig="Generally">Generally</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_203" data-source="" data-orig="white sesame is preferred for oil extraction due to its thinner shell">white sesame is preferred for oil extraction due to its thinner shell</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_204" data-source="" data-orig="allowing easier separation and higher oil quality">allowing easier separation and higher oil quality</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_205" data-source="" data-orig="It also provides better economic returns">It also provides better economic returns</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_206" data-source="" data-orig="In contrast">In contrast</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_207" data-source="" data-orig="black sesame yields less oil due to its tougher shell but contains more protein and trace elements">black sesame yields less oil due to its tougher shell but contains more protein and trace elements</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_208" data-source="" data-orig="making it beneficial for health">making it beneficial for health</span>. <span class ="tr_" id="tr_209" data-source="" data-orig="Its rich aroma and flavor make black sesame oil suitable for upscale dining">Its rich aroma and flavor make black sesame oil suitable for upscale dining</span>.</p><p>注記: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_210" data-source="" data-orig="The nutritional and medicinal values of black sesame referenced are sourced from">The nutritional and medicinal values of black sesame referenced are sourced from</span> &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_211" data-source="" data-orig="Compendium of Materia Medica">Compendium of Materia Medica</span>,&#8221; &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_212" data-source="" data-orig="Shennong Bencao Jing">Shennong Bencao Jing</span>,&#8221; そして &#8220;<span class ="tr_" id="tr_213" data-source="" data-orig="Ming Yi Lu.">Ming Yi Lu.</span>&#8221;</p>`} />
